    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll try the elevation thing. i actually have some ibuprofen here too, is it safe to take a couple of those to help with the swelling and the ache? i just really want to sleep this off and feel normal by tomorrow without having to deal with a clinic or anything. it feels like it's just my body being sluggish from the trip.",
